CVAE-Opt adaptation includes Encoder, Pointer, Attention and Embedding code from
André Hottung, Bhanu Bhandari and Kevin Tierney, Learning a Latent Search Space
for Routing Problems using Variational Autoencoders, ICLR 2021.
Upstream: https://github.com/ahottung/CVAE-Opt
The upstream code is licensed under GPL-3.0; see licenses/CVAE-Opt_LICENSE.
Upstream also credits https://github.com/mveres01/pytorch-drl4vrp.
The DTS adaptation uses task-processor pair tokens, feasibility masks and a
structural-history head. Trans-RL is a two-role scheduling adaptation.
